## Model card

- **Name:** Doubao Seed Evolving
- **Short description:** ByteDance's continuously-updating Coding & Agent model on Volcano Engine Ark, served under a single stable model ID that "高频迭代，持续进化" (iterates at high frequency, continuously evolving its coding and agent capabilities) — Ark's 首推 (top-recommended) text-generation entry, with first-class integration pages for Claude Code, Codex, Trae, DeepSeek Harness, Pi, OpenCode and OpenClaw.
- **Provider / access:** Volcano Engine Ark, model ID `doubao-seed-evolving`; Chat Completions (`/chat/completions`), Responses (`/responses`), Messages (`/messages`), Tokenization endpoints; online + batch inference; explicit and implicit context caching; model fine-tuning offered. Rate limits per the model list: max 500 RPM / 1,000,000 TPM.
- **Release / knowledge:** live on Ark as of the 2026-11-13 docs fetch (model-list "Last Updated" Nov 2026); no fixed release date — the ID is a moving pointer to the latest weekly checkpoint. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `doubao-seed-evolving` (the only ID — deliberately version-less).
- **Context window:** 1,024K (1M) tokens total; max input 1,024K; max output 256K; max thinking chain 256K — verified from both the Ark model page and model list.
- **Modalities:** text, image, and video input → text output; deep thinking enabled by default with efforts low/medium/high/minimal; structured output; tools (Responses API): Function Call, web search (联网搜索), knowledge base, MCP. Implicit + explicit (prefix/session) caching.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** not verified in this pass (Ark pricing page not fetched; no per-token figure on the fetched surfaces).
- **Architecture:** not published — parameter count, MoE structure and per-week checkpoint identity unverified; the "evolving" ID means measured figures can only be cited against a fetch date.

